{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51058","headline":"题崇元观（在吉水县） · 吕岩","name":"题崇元观（在吉水县）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"褰裳嬾步寻真宿，清景一宵吟不足。\n月在碧潭风在松，何必洞天三十六。\n（同前引宋祝穆撰《方舆胜览》。\n见《方舆胜览》卷二十《吉州》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}